{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single Player Experience</strong><br>The player must survive the night through careful observation and making the right decisions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/extras/gif6.gif?t=1745846136\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story-Driven Gameplay</strong><br>The game offers a slow-burning mystery that gradually unfolds. You'll face reality-distorting events, confront your past, and deal with threats beyond comprehension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/extras/gif2.gif?t=1745846136\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Linear and Mission-Based Structure</strong><br>This is not an open-world game. It progresses through a series of structured events and tasks that increase in difficulty and tension over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Average Playtime: 2\u201320 Hours</strong> <br>Average playtime ranges from 2 to 20 hours. Observation, attention, and reaction time can influence this duration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited Replayability</strong><br>The game has a set ending. However, anomalies and event timing are randomized, encouraging players to replay for a slightly different experience each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/extras/gif4.gif?t=1745846136\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core Content and Mechanics</strong><br>\u2013 15 different security camera feeds<br>\u2013 Real-time surveillance and anomaly reporting<br>\u2013 Tasks requiring physical intervention (server resets, bomb defusal)<br>\u2013 Defensive mechanics such as hiding and locking doors<br>\u2013 Story-driven visuals and environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/extras/gif3.gif?t=1745846136\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/extras/gif5.gif?t=1745846136\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time-Based Gameplay Structure</strong><br>The game takes place over a 7-hour in-game night shift. Each hour introduces new threats and challenges, increasing pressure and difficulty as time progresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Visual Style and Atmosphere</strong><br>The visual design mimics low-resolution security camera feeds, paired with eerie lighting and unsettling soundscapes to build a tense and immersive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RTX and DLSS Support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your graphics performance and improve image quality with RTX and DLSS support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/extras/rtxgif.gif?t=1745846136\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618890?t=1745846136","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/39d80f36efff5781acbdf0f5dfb7fb6f0986f00b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745846136","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/2c1021b99738d8cbba310d70662c7dff90fd1ea2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745846136","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618890/2c1021b99738d8cbba310d70662c7dff90fd1ea2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745846136","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes"